	<brief_description>
		Imported Gaussian splat asset resource.
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		The [Resource] produced by importing a Gaussian capture (PLY, SPZ, or [code].gsplatworld[/code]). It stores the decoded — optionally quantized and pruned — dataset together with import metadata, and can populate a runtime [GaussianData] for rendering.
	</description>
